{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Likhovo, a small town at the heart of the Slavic Federation. Following the outbreak of an alien pathogen, this place became the epicenter of a spreading infection. Forests crawling with <strong>mutants</strong>, roads blocked by <strong>bandits</strong>, and <strong>stalkers</strong> watching your every move \u2014 these are just a few of the dangers this region has to offer. Join the Alliance and a handful of other survivors in a desperate struggle to stay alive in this unforgiving post-apocalyptic world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets hit hard, and mistakes linger. You\u2019ll need to set broken bones, stop the bleeding, and deal with infections \u2014 or things get worse fast. Enemies don\u2019t wait around either: they move in groups, talk to each other, hear your footsteps, and know when to fall back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD FULL OF DANGERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying landscape twisted by alien contamination. Mutants roam the wilderness, hostile survivors hunt the weak, and every encounter can be your last. Complete missions, survive the wild, and uncover the buried secrets of Likhovo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP WEAPON AND GEAR CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapons and armor to suit your playstyle. From suppressors to precision scopes and reinforced plating, every item can be tailored for stealth, speed, or raw power. Tinker with attachments, swap parts, and build a loadout that gives you the edge in every fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR FACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/3100849e9136d440976c929fef99d874.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/3100849e9136d440976c929fef99d874.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/3100849e9136d440976c929fef99d874.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the struggling Alliance, desperate to bring order back to the region \u2014 or embrace the chaos with the fanatical Sectarians. Deal with ruthless bandit gangs or earn the respect of lone Stalkers who live by their own rules. Build your reputation through actions, unlock unique gear and be prepared for consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/5639e6740f9b0ad112a49927d9ea3431.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/5639e6740f9b0ad112a49927d9ea3431.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/5639e6740f9b0ad112a49927d9ea3431.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Likhovo hides many treasures \u2014 some are hidden, some are guarded. Master the inventory management and loot evaluation. Each item has its own value for survival! But hurry, you are not the only one who wants to take the riches of the Zone...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASE OF OPERATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/0beb97ea33c3287e221456d463bc45d4.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/0beb97ea33c3287e221456d463bc45d4.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/0beb97ea33c3287e221456d463bc45d4.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable NPCs, trade hard-earned resources, and take on missions from those clinging to what's left. Scavenge the ruins for materials to upgrade <strong>your own shelter</strong>, unlock new crafting stations, and build what you need to survive in this unforgiving world. Your base is where plans are made, gear is prepared, and the next day\u2019s survival begins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299010?t=1762541613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299010?t=1762541613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/7573a8400509fd3e3d488e3cc4dee4dff2437dd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762541613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/7573a8400509fd3e3d488e3cc4dee4dff2437dd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762541613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood spatter and violence depicted in a cartoon format. Some adult language can be found in character interactions and dialogue. Characters in the game may use tobacco, alcohol, and fictitious medications."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Likhovo, a small town at the heart of the Slavic Federation. Following the outbreak of an alien pathogen, this place became the epicenter of a spreading infection. Forests crawling with <strong>mutants</strong>, roads blocked by <strong>bandits</strong>, and <strong>stalkers</strong> watching your every move \u2014 these are just a few of the dangers this region has to offer. Join the Alliance and a handful of other survivors in a desperate struggle to stay alive in this unforgiving post-apocalyptic world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/bfbb52401d1570e754e7b9944503a926.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets hit hard, and mistakes linger. You\u2019ll need to set broken bones, stop the bleeding, and deal with infections \u2014 or things get worse fast. Enemies don\u2019t wait around either: they move in groups, talk to each other, hear your footsteps, and know when to fall back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD FULL OF DANGERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/c41da731a299d4610118e03aa3bd8c35.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying landscape twisted by alien contamination. Mutants roam the wilderness, hostile survivors hunt the weak, and every encounter can be your last. Complete missions, survive the wild, and uncover the buried secrets of Likhovo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP WEAPON AND GEAR CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.webm?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/991e0d0bf1355ef58608aba3bfe9f2ab.mp4?t=1762541613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapons and armor to suit your playstyle. From suppressors to precision scopes and reinforced plating, every item can be tailored for stealth, speed, or raw power. Tinker with attachments, swap parts, and build a loadout that gives you the edge in every fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR FACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/3100849e9136d440976c929fef99d874.poster.avif?t=1762541613\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299010/extras/3100849e9136